docs {
  # Files
  
  Public CMS API file endpoints under `/api/v1/files*`.
  
  Gated by **Files access** on the role (global — not per-folder).
  
  Actions: `create` | `read` | `read_private` | `update` | `delete`.
  
  Missing grant = **deny** (403).
  
  ## Public vs private
  
  | Effective `access` | Role has `read` only | Role has `read` + `read_private` |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | public / inherit→public | List / show / content / transform **200** | Same |
  | private | List **omits** row; get/content/transform **403** | Full access |
  
  Typical **`public`** role: Read ✓, Read private ✕.
  
  Item expanders (image/file/files): private without `read_private` → `null` / omit (no id leak).
  
  Shared env: `base_url`, `api_key`. Per-request file targets use each request's local `file_id`.
}
